    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "👀<br/><b>Tag:</b><br/>#wearablepumps #momcozybreastpump #pumpingmom #pumpingtips #ad<br/><b>@momcozy_breastfeeding</b><br/><b>@momcozyofficial</b></td><td>[00:00] Wait, mga mommy, akala niyo po ba warmth lang yung special sa pump na 'to?<br/>[00:03] Ah-ah.<br/>[00:04] Ito pong white flange ang nagbibigay ng warmth sa breast natin kapag nagpa-pump tayo.<br/>[00:08] Pero kapag tinanggal natin siya, surprise, makikita natin yung 5-zone suction sync massage.<br/>[00:13] So, mga kapulungan, marami pong nagtatanong kung ano daw yung breast pump na ginagamit ko at kung ano yung mare-recommend ko.<br/>[00:19] Honestly, depende talaga 'yan kung ano yung kailangan niyo.<br/>[00:22] Kaya papakita ko po sa inyo itong dalawang 'tong, Momcozy M5 Smart at ang Wellness 1, para may options kayo dahil may kanya-kanya din silang priorities.<br/>[00:30] Unahin natin dito sa M5 Smart.<br/>[00:33] This one is more portable and versatile, especially po for the moms na kailangan ng flexibility sa everyday routine.<br/>[00:38] For someone na medyo bago pa po sa pagsusuot ng pumps, I really like how straightforward the M5 Smart feels.<br/>[00:44] Kapag napakarami po nating ginagawa, naglilinis ng bahay, nag-aalaga kay baby, nagwo-work, ito pong M5 Smart fits perfectly into my routine.<br/>[00:52] Isa pa pong biggest upgrade na na-appreciate ko dito sa M5 Smart is yung Momcozy app.<br/>[00:57] So, dito po pwede mong i-connect yung pump mo sa phone mo, which makes pumping more convenient.<br/>[1:02] Dito, mako-control mo both pumps directly from your phone.<br/>[1:06] Pwede kang pumili between stimulation, expression, at mixed mode, at i-adjust din yung suction level depende sa comfort mo.<br/>[1:12] Nare-record din sa application yung pumping sessions mo at pagkatapos, pwede mong ilagay kung gaano karaming milk na ang na-pump mo at i-save yung session.<br/>[1:19] Ang galing, 'no?<br/>[1:20] Ngayon, kung comfort naman po ang top priority, nakikita niyo 'to sa vlog ko, itong Wellness 1 ang nag-stand out.<br/>[1:26] Meron siyang specific features para sa mga mommies na makapagbigay ng comfort at different kind of pumping experience.<br/>[1:35] At dahil katatapos lang natin mag-pump, mano-notice mo talaga kaagad yung full surface warmth.<br/>[1:39] So, sa buong breast mo, hindi lang sa one area.<br/>[1:41] Meron din siyang 5-zone suction sync massage na nagke-create ng rhythmic feeling kaya mare-relax ka talaga habang nagpapa-pump.<br/>[1:48] So, yung combination ng warmth and then itong massage, grabe yung combination nila, especially kapag feeling mo full na full ka na, uncomfortable ka, iba yung experience na mapi-feel mo.<br/>[2:01] At kahit po comfort focus siya, I can still fit it into my business workday.<br/>[2:05] Nagustuhan ko rin po yung smart app control dahil pwede nating i-adjust yung pumping settings directly from my phone, which is especially convenient kapag po busy tayo.<br/>[2:13] After naman po natin mag-pump, yung one-press assembly at yung only five parts to clean make the cleanup pretty straightforward.<br/>[2:20] Para sa mommies na kagaya natin na ginagawa 'to multiple times a day, maa-appreciate talaga natin yung little convenience.<br/>[2:28] So, na-try na po natin pareho, pero depende po talaga sa inyo kung ano yung pinaka-kailangan niyo.<br/>[2:32] Kung gusto niyo po yung classic, all-in-one, busy kayo, itong M5.<br/>[2:36] Pero kung gusto niyo naman po yung comfort, yun yung priority niyo, ito pong Wellness 1 yung option at yung mare-recommend ko.<br/>[2:42] Lalo na po yung combination ng full surface warmth at yung 5-zone suction sync massage.<br/>[2:46] Kaya naman mga mommies, hindi ito about kung ano ba yung better, kundi kung ano yung best para sa'yo, kung ano yung kailangan mo at kung ano yung magwo-work sa routine mo.<br/>[2:54] So, mga mamas, kayo po ba ay team smart convenience or team comfort?<br/>[2:58] Paki-comment po sa baba.<br/>[2:59] Thank you.<br/>[3:00] Bye.</td><td>[00:00] 等等，各位妈妈，你们以为这款吸奶器只有加热功能特别吗？<br/>[00:03] 不止哦。<br/>[00:04] 这个白色法兰盘能在我们吸奶时为乳房提供温感。<br/>[00:08] 但当我们把它取下来，惊喜来了，可以看到 5-zone suction sync massage 功能。<br/>[00:13] 所以，各位妈妈，很多人问我平时用的是哪款吸奶器，以及我推荐哪一款。<br/>[00:19] 说实话，这真的取决于你们的需求。<br/>[00:22] 所以我今天展示这两款：Momcozy M5 Smart 和 Wellness 1，给你们提供一些选择，因为它们各有各的侧重点。<br/>[00:30] 我们先从 M5 Smart 开始。<br/>[00:33] 这款更便携、更全能，特别适合那些日常生活中需要灵活性的妈妈们。<br/>[00:38] 对于刚开始使用吸奶器的人来说，我真的很喜欢 M5 Smart 这种直观的操作感。<br/>[00:44] 当我们忙得不可开交，又要打扫卫生、照顾宝宝、又要工作时，M5 Smart 能完美融入我的日常节奏。<br/>[00:52] 我在 M5 Smart 上最欣赏的另一个重大升级是 Momcozy app。<br/>[00:57] 你可以将吸奶器连接到手机上，让吸奶变得更方便。<br/>[1:02] 在这里，你可以直接通过手机控制两边的吸奶器。<br/>[1:06] 你可以在刺激模式、吸乳模式和混合模式之间切换，并根据舒适度调整吸力等级。<br/>[1:12] 应用程序还会记录你的吸奶过程，结束后，你可以输入吸出的奶量并保存记录。<br/>[1:19] 是不是很棒？<br/>[1:20] 现在，如果你的首要需求是舒适度，就像你们在我的视频里看到的那样，Wellness 1 表现非常突出。<br/>[1:26] 它拥有专门的功能，能为妈妈们提供舒适感和与众不同的吸奶体验。<br/>[1:35] 而且因为我们刚吸完奶，你真的能立刻感受到全方位的温感。<br/>[1:39] 是覆盖整个乳房，而不仅仅是一个区域。<br/>[1:41] 它还有 5-zone suction sync massage，能创造出一种有节奏的律动感，让你在吸奶时真正放松下来。<br/>[1:48] 所以，温感和按摩的结合效果非常惊人，尤其是当你感觉涨奶、很不舒服的时候，那种体验感完全不同。<br/>[2:01] 尽管它主打舒适，但我依然可以在忙碌的工作日中使用它。<br/>[2:05] 我也很喜欢它的智能 app 控制功能，因为我们可以直接通过手机调整吸奶设置，这在我们忙碌时特别方便。<br/>[2:13] 吸奶结束后，一键组装和仅需清洗五个部件的设计，让清理工作变得非常简单。<br/>[2:20] 对于像我们这样每天要多次吸奶的妈妈来说，这种小小的便利真的非常贴心。<br/>[2:28] 所以，这两款我都试过了，但最终还是取决于你最需要什么。<br/>[2:32] 如果你喜欢经典、一体化且生活忙碌，选 M5。<br/>[2:36] 但如果你追求舒适，这是你的首要考量，那么 Wellness 1 就是我推荐的选择。<br/>[2:42] 特别是它全方位温感和 5-zone suction sync massage 的组合。<br/>[2:46] 所以各位妈妈，这无关哪款更好，而是哪款最适合你，取决于你的需求以及哪款更契合你的生活节奏。<br/>[2:54] 那么，各位妈妈，你们是“智能便捷派”还是“舒适至上派”呢？<br/>[2:58] 请在下方评论区告诉我。<br/>[2:59] 谢谢。<br/>[3:00] 拜拜。</td><td><ol><li seq=\"1\">已补充“One Press\"镜头</li><li>已补充Capton和Cover，建议可发布啦</li></ol></td><td>发布！</td></tr></tbody></table>",
