      "text": "<table><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><b>Script</b></td><td><b>Translation</b></td><td><b>钛动反馈</b></td><td><b>客户反馈</b></td></tr><tr><td>MOMCOZY M5 SMART &amp; WELLNESS 1<br/>Two Different Pumps for Different Moments<br/>HOOK<br/>Visual: Hold both M5 Smart and Wellness 1.<br/>VO:<br/>“As a first-time mom who’s also working, I’ve learned that my pumping needs aren’t always the same.”<br/>“Sometimes I need to keep moving and get things done, and sometimes I finally have a moment to slow down and focus on comfort.”<br/>“That’s why I use both the Momcozy M5 Smart and Wellness 1—but for different moments in my day.”<br/>⸻<br/>M5 SMART — FOR MY BUSY MOM DAYS<br/>Visual: Put on M5 Smart → work at your desk → walk around the house → prepare bottles → do light chores.<br/>VO:<br/>“When I have a lot going on, the M5 Smart fits perfectly into my routine.”<br/>“It’s wearable and hands-free, so I can pump while I’m working at my desk, moving around the house, preparing my baby’s things, or just getting things done.”<br/>Visual: Show phone/app while continuing your routine.<br/>VO:<br/>“I also love that I can monitor and control my pumping session through the app, so I don’t have to keep stopping what I’m doing.”<br/>“For me, the M5 Smart is all about making pumping easier to fit into a busy day.”<br/>On-screen text:<br/>M5 Smart<br/>Wearable • Hands-Free • App Control<br/>⸻<br/>WELLNESS 1 — FOR MY COMFORT MOMENTS<br/>Visual: Transition from busy routine → sit comfortably on the bed or couch → put on Wellness 1.<br/>VO:<br/>“Then there are moments when I actually have time to sit down, slow down, and make my pumping session more comfortable.”<br/>“That’s when the Wellness 1 fits into my routine.”<br/>Visual: Close-up of W1 flange and warming/massage areas.<br/>VO:<br/>“What makes the experience different is the combination of Full-Surface Warmth and 5-Zone Suction-Synced Massage.”<br/>“The warmth covers the breast-contact area, while the gentle massage works with the rhythm of the pump.”<br/>“Especially when I’m feeling full or uncomfortable, I really appreciate having that warmth and massage while I pump.”<br/>On-screen text:<br/>Wellness 1<br/>Full-Surface Warmth • 5-Zone Massage<br/>⸻<br/>W1 — SOFTPULSE + EASY CLEANING<br/>Visual: Natural pumping footage → disassemble W1 and show the parts.<br/>VO:<br/>“It also has SoftPulse Baby-Like Suction for a smooth, gentle pumping experience.”<br/>“And with only five washable parts, cleanup is simple—which is something I definitely appreciate as a mom who pumps multiple times a day.”<br/>⸻<br/>TWO DIFFERENT MOMENTS<br/>Visual: Split or alternating scenes:<br/>M5 Smart → working/moving around<br/>W1 → sitting comfortably/relaxing<br/>VO:<br/>“So instead of asking which one is better, I think about what I need at that moment.”<br/>“If I have work to finish, things to do around the house, or I simply need the freedom to move around, I can reach for my M5 Smart.”<br/>“And when I have the opportunity to slow down and want a more comfort-focused pumping session, I can reach for my Wellness 1.”<br/>⸻<br/>FIRST-TIME MOM ENDING<br/>Visual: Clips of you working → caring for baby → pumping → both products together.<br/>VO:<br/>“As a first-time mom, every day looks a little different.",
