    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "WELLNESS 1<br/>HOOK<br/>Visual: Hold both pumps.<br/>VO:<br/>“I’ve been using both the Momcozy M5 Smart and Wellness 1, and I actually reach for them for different reasons depending on what I need during the day.”<br/>⸻<br/>M5 SMART — MOBILITY &amp; CONVENIENCE<br/>Visual: Wear M5 Smart while working, walking around the house, preparing bottles, etc.<br/>VO:<br/>“When I have a busy day and still need to get things done, I usually reach for my M5 Smart.”<br/>“It’s wearable and hands-free, so I can pump while working at my desk, walking around the house, or multitasking.”<br/>⸻<br/>WELLNESS 1 — COMFORT<br/>Visual: Transition from being busy → sit comfortably → put on W1.<br/>VO:<br/>“But when I have the chance to slow down, that’s when I reach for my Wellness 1.”<br/>“What really stands out to me is the combination of Full-Surface Warmth and the 5-Zone Suction-Synced Massage.”<br/>Visual: Close-up of warming and massage areas.<br/>“The warmth covers the breast-contact area, while the gentle massage follows the rhythm of the pump.”<br/>“Especially when I’m feeling full or uncomfortable, having both together makes my pumping session feel so much more soothing and relaxing.”<br/>“It also has SoftPulse Baby-Like Suction, which gives me a smoother and gentler pumping experience.”<br/>⸻<br/>EASY CLEANING<br/>Visual: Take apart W1 and show washable components.<br/>VO:<br/>“And because I pump multiple times a day, I appreciate the practical things too.",
